WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.385 --> 00:00:03.885
(mellow electronic music)

00:00:07.412 --> 00:00:09.685
- I was called names such as monster,

00:00:09.685 --> 00:00:11.602
two-face and scar face.

00:00:12.931 --> 00:00:14.875
Hey guys, welcome back to my channel.

00:00:14.875 --> 00:00:17.029
Posting my videos made me realize

00:00:17.029 --> 00:00:19.029
that this is my mission.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.754
I wouldn't take it back.

00:00:21.754 --> 00:00:25.921
This is absolutely the
reason why it happened to me.

00:00:36.795 --> 00:00:38.833
Hey guys, welcome back to my channel.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:40.785
If you're new, my name is Shalom Blac.

00:00:40.785 --> 00:00:44.024
Today, we are going to be doing makeup.

00:00:44.024 --> 00:00:46.777
My name is Shalom, and
I make YouTube videos.

00:00:46.777 --> 00:00:48.434
I teach people how to do makeup

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.450
and also encourage them to love themselves

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.450
for who they are without the makeup.

00:00:56.698 --> 00:00:59.802
I was burned by cooking oil
when I was nine years old

00:00:59.802 --> 00:01:03.302
in my mother's restaurant back in Nigeria.

00:01:04.144 --> 00:01:06.295
I remember waking up just screaming

00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:10.295
and pulling off my skin
and rubbing off my face.

00:01:12.201 --> 00:01:14.701
It was really terrible for me.

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.780
I thought of suicide.

00:01:20.784 --> 00:01:22.792
I was in the mirror
just looking at myself,

00:01:22.792 --> 00:01:25.792
like, why don't people just like me?

00:01:27.185 --> 00:01:28.474
And I know that my mom loved me

00:01:28.474 --> 00:01:32.641
and she would be really, um, sad
to lose a child, you know,

00:01:34.612 --> 00:01:36.914
because she felt like
she already lost one.

00:01:36.914 --> 00:01:37.747
I'm sorry.

00:01:50.425 --> 00:01:52.340
This is real pretty.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:55.296
I started to feel better about myself

00:01:55.296 --> 00:01:58.787
when I saw other people
that were burned, too,

00:01:58.787 --> 00:02:01.740
and I wanted to help people like me.

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:05.247
My solution was trying to cover up my scar

00:02:05.247 --> 00:02:08.165
so I thought why not makeup?

00:02:08.165 --> 00:02:10.823
This is gonna be a
talk-through, step-by-step,

00:02:10.823 --> 00:02:13.740
how I cover up the scar on my face.

00:02:15.245 --> 00:02:16.499
When I get comments from my viewers

00:02:16.499 --> 00:02:18.337
telling me that I help them,

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:21.153
it makes me remember why I'm doing this.

00:02:21.153 --> 00:02:23.949
I like to focus positivity
on my videos, you know,

00:02:23.949 --> 00:02:25.562
not just putting on the makeup,

00:02:25.562 --> 00:02:28.633
but having a message that comes with it,

00:02:28.633 --> 00:02:31.718
that makeup isn't just what
I love to do, you know.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.158
I wanna make you feel good

00:02:33.158 --> 00:02:36.545
even when you don't have the make up on.

00:02:36.545 --> 00:02:38.937
I'm just happy because I found myself.

00:02:38.937 --> 00:02:41.270
I learned to accept my scars,

00:02:42.808 --> 00:02:45.975
and I also just love me for who I am.

